{"product_id":"buture-vc90-cordless-vacuum-cleaner","title":"Buture VC90 Cordless Stick Vacuum Cleaner | 650W 55KPA","description":"\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButure Most Powerful Vacuum VC90 – Unleash Next-Level Cleaning Power!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntroducing the Buture VC90 – the most powerful and intelligent cordless vacuum in the Buture lineup. Designed to elevate your home cleaning experience, the VC90 combines cutting-edge suction technology, smart features, and ergonomic design for a deeper, faster, and more effortless clean. Whether you're tackling hardwood floors, deep carpets, pet hair, or upholstery, the Buture VC90 Vacuum is your all-in-one cleaning solution.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan\u003e650W Brushless Motor \u0026amp; 55KPA Extreme Suction\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAt the heart of the Buture VC90 Vacuum lies a next-gen 650W brushless motor, delivering a staggering 55KPA of suction power – the highest in the Buture vacuum series. Effortlessly lift embedded dirt, dust, hair, and debris in one smooth pass. From daily maintenance to deep cleaning, nothing escapes its powerful pull.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntelligent Auto Mode with Smart Floor Detection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForget manual adjustments. The Buture VC90 Vacuum features an Auto Smart Sensor Mode that detects different floor types and automatically adjusts suction power in real-time. It conserves battery when cleaning smooth surfaces and boosts power when tackling thick carpets — giving you optimized performance and longer runtime, all without lifting a finger.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUp to 60 Minutes Runtime with 8-Cell Detachable Battery\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePowered by a high-capacity 8-cell lithium-ion battery, the Buture VC90 Vacuum provides up to 60 minutes of uninterrupted cleaning in Eco mode. The detachable battery pack supports quick charging and easy replacement, so you can extend your cleaning time with a spare battery (sold separately).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMulti-Surface Cleaning with Specialized Tools\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFrom floors to ceilings — and everything in between. The Buture VC90 Vacuum comes with a suite of versatile attachments:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMotorized Mattress Brush: Removes allergens and pet hair from beds, sofas, and stairs.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2-in-1 Dusting Brush \u0026amp; Crevice Tool: Ideal for corners, tight spaces, and delicate surfaces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTelescopic Wand: Extends your reach to clean drapes, high shelves, and ceiling edges.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eQuickly switch between upright and handheld mode for complete home or car cleaning convenience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAdvanced 5-Stage HEPA Filtration System\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBreathe easier with the high-performance multi-layer filtration system, which captures up to 99.99% of microscopic dust and allergens. The fully sealed design prevents secondary pollution and releases only clean air — perfect for allergy sufferers and pet owners.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSelf-Standing \u0026amp; Integrated Wall Mount Charging\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNo need to lean your vacuum against the wall anymore! The self-standing design offers maximum convenience during cleaning pauses and easy storage. Plus, the 2-in-1 wall mount functions as both a charger and accessory holder, keeping your home tidy and your vacuum always ready.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSleek Design Meets Buture Reliability\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith its minimalist aesthetic, impressed suction, and easy operation (button control), the VC90 fits seamlessly into modern homes. Backed by Buture’s trusted customer service and warranty, this vacuum is built to perform and last.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose the Buture VC90 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eButure's top performance: 650W motor and 55KPA suction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAll-in-one solution: upright + handheld.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmart auto adjustment for all floor types.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLong-lasting, 60 minutes battery life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecialized tools for mattresses, furniture, crevices \u0026amp; more.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHygienic, sealed HEPA filtration system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"4ever-article\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e✅ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCordless convenience, whisper-quiet design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhat's in the Box?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMain unit *1, Battery *1, Electric floor brush (roller included) *1, Mattress brush *1, 2-in-1 brush *1, Crevice brush *1, Wall Mount *1, HEPA filter *2, Telescopic Tube *1, Power adapter *1 and Instruction manual *1\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 99.8214%; height: 215.532px;\" width=\"100%\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.9259%; height: 19.5938px; text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003cspan\u003eColor\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 66.7152%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGolden Black\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.9259%; height: 19.5938px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eForm Factor\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 66.7152%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStick, Handheld\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.9259%; height: 19.5938px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 66.7152%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e55000Pa\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 32.9259%; height: 19.5938px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePower Consumption\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 66.7152%; height: 19.5938px;\"\u003e\